# The Golod–Shafarevich inequality

For every nontrivial finite 2-group `H`, `dim H²(H,𝔽₂) > d(H)²/4`.

Paper reference: Theorem 2.33 of Dérickx–Gillibert–Keller–Pagano, *Golod–Shafarevich for arithmetic
surfaces*.  Formalization plan: `LEAN-PLAN.md`.
-/
